<div class="modal fade"
     id="hint1"
     tabindex="-1"
     aria-labelledby="hintLabel"
     aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-scrollable modal-lg">
    <div class="modal-content">
      <div class="modal-header">
        <h5 class="modal-title fw-bold"
            id="hintLabel">操作提示 (點開按鈕看說明)</h5>
        <button type="button"
                class="btn-close"
                data-bs-dismiss="modal"
                aria-label="關閉"></button>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body">
        {{>common-notes01}}
        <p>
          <button class="btn btn-success"
                  type="button"
                  data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                  data-bs-target="#ifo-performance"
                  aria-expanded="false"
                  aria-controls="ifo-performance">
            門市業績表 ▼
          </button>
        </p>
        <div class="collapse mb-3"
             id="ifo-performance">
          <div class="card card-body">
            <div class="alert alert-secondary"
                 role="alert">
              <p class="fw-bold mb-0"><i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation"
                   style="color: rgb(75, 75, 75);"></i> 僅會抓取「核准」單據</p>
              <p class="fw-bold mb-0"><i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation"
                   style="color: rgb(75, 75, 75);"></i> 無輸入貴賓資料之單據，一律歸類為門市客</p>
              <p class="fw-bold mb-0"><i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation"
                   style="color: rgb(75, 75, 75);"></i> 將依照「貴賓群組」計算業績</p>
              <p class="fw-bold mb-0"><i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation"
                   style="color: rgb(75, 75, 75);"></i> 請務必依照SOP流程新增門市客以外的貴賓資料，避免設定造成單據資料需要手動修改</p>

              <p class="fw-bold mb-0"><i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation"
                   style="color: rgb(75, 75, 75);"></i> 「店自用」請使用【領用】功能key單!!</p>
            </div>
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-primary">步驟說明</span></p>
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-secondary">1</span> 請選擇 [日期範圍]，無輸入則只抓當天資料</p>
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-secondary">2</span> 請選擇 [銷售門市]，無輸入則抓取全部門市資料</p>
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-secondary">3</span> 請選擇 [貴賓群組]，無輸入則抓取全部單據資料</p>
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-secondary">4</span> 選擇完畢後，按下按鈕［下載］，即可下載ERP匯入檔案 </p>
            <hr>
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-primary">金額欄位說明</span></p>
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-secondary">單價</span> 商品售出價格</p>
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-secondary">加值</span> 會顯示加值名稱，如：保養廠、機車行</p>
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-secondary">總折讓</span> 單品項總折讓 (包含 單品項折扣 與 整單折扣) </p>
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-secondary">小計(稅前價)</span> 單價 × 數量 + 總折讓</p>

          </div>
        </div>

        {{>common-notes02}}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>